/3153960/extras/aedda9feaac880de661e5be589cad8d1.avif?t=1733489624\" width=560 height=117 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153960/extras/8b7f6335782baee2bfb8d4734ab4484a.poster.avif?t=1733489624\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153960/extras/8b7f6335782baee2bfb8d4734ab4484a.webm?t=1733489624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153960/extras/8b7f6335782baee2bfb8d4734ab4484a.mp4?t=1733489624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manage the day-to-day operations of your restaurant. Take orders, serve a diverse menu, and ensure that your customers leave satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153960/extras/b4542ac915484fe23f70fa0490f46838.avif?t=1733489624\" width=560 height=117 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153960/extras/dea008c84da609438d2c8ad6edf6e420.poster.avif?t=1733489624\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153960/extras/dea008c84da609438d2c8ad6edf6e420.webm?t=1733489624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153960/extras/dea008c84da609438d2c8ad6edf6e420.mp4?t=1733489624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to turn your restaurant dreams into reality? <strong>Restaurant Owner: Prologue</strong> offers a rich and rewarding gameplay experience for simulation enthusiasts and aspiring restaurateurs, with more to come in the full version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <i>Note: This is a Prologue version of <strong>Restaurant Owner</strong> and is still in active development. As such, all images, information, and features described on this store page are subject to change as the game continues to evolve.</i></p>",
